WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:02.120
A modest gift

00:02.200 --> 00:03.867
Just a token of sincerity

00:07.520 --> 00:08.560
The Wutu people spend their whole lives

00:08.640 --> 00:10.040
Living on horseback

00:10.200 --> 00:11.600
We Xuan people are different

00:11.680 --> 00:12.720
So I made improvements

00:12.800 --> 00:14.080
According to Xuan people's habits

00:14.160 --> 00:15.240
Specially sought skilled craftsmen

00:15.320 --> 00:16.240
To forge a pair

00:16.320 --> 00:16.800
Eagerly brought them

00:16.880 --> 00:18.480
For the general to try

00:18.560 --> 00:19.920
I heard these past two days

00:20.040 --> 00:20.720
Your Highness

00:20.800 --> 00:22.480
Has been busy writing inscriptions for people

00:22.560 --> 00:23.200
It really

00:23.280 --> 00:24.680
Must be tiring

00:25.880 --> 00:27.000
Hobby

00:27.080 --> 00:28.480
Just a hobby

00:29.440 --> 00:30.840
I remember

00:31.040 --> 00:32.960
Last year the court discussed going north

00:33.040 --> 00:34.200
But because the treasury was empty

00:34.280 --> 00:35.360
No money, no grain

00:35.440 --> 00:36.960
It came to nothing in the end

00:37.040 --> 00:38.600
Looking at it this way

00:38.680 --> 00:40.680
From last year to this year

00:41.920 --> 00:42.600
Elder brother has

00:42.680 --> 00:43.680
Been managing the household well

00:43.800 --> 00:44.440
General

00:44.560 --> 00:46.120
Rarely returns to the capital

00:46.200 --> 00:48.200
Even if I treat myself poorly

00:48.680 --> 00:49.480
I cannot treat poorly

00:49.560 --> 00:51.227
The pillars of the state

00:52.040 --> 00:53.200
Your Highness overpraises

00:53.280 --> 00:55.080
You humble your subject too much

00:55.160 --> 00:55.800
I also ask

00:55.960 --> 00:58.360
Prince of Jin to be cautious with words

00:58.440 --> 00:59.480
The inner hall is about to begin the banquet

00:59.560 --> 01:00.200
Prince of Jin

01:00.280 --> 01:01.200
Prince of Ning

01:01.280 --> 01:01.920
Please

01:02.040 --> 01:03.440
Please, please
